'''Curses!!!''' (うーらーめーしーにゃ, ''Ū Rā Mē Shī Nya'', '''Eennvvyy''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 2700.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

